{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "c1e3e58276cb4ddcd70a5da471cbc189f4909a5bda7d8c1c0b603fb0b6c20c12", "ja": "名探偵？ウォーカーの活躍", "zh": "名侦探？沃克的活跃表现", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b339187cde155984983d5ee499a5a2ff8a80fa14df51cda52acad15ed80fff17", "ja": "「台本を盗んだのはプロデューサーだ」と\nいう紬の推理は、見事な空振りに終わった。\nだがその推理と桃子の言葉に背中を押された\n琴葉は、自身の悩みを打ち明ける。「私を、\nみんなとの稽古から外してほしいんです」", "zh": "䌷推测「偷走剧本的人就是制作人」，\n但最后证实了她的推理落空。\n然而琴叶在䌷的推理与桃子的话语推动之下，\n坦白说出自己的烦恼。\n「希望别让我和大家一起排演。」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7c17ba8d859409d0dfceec81f61bcab1469c833ed580db6cdb09c5fd39a7ddb4", "ja": "どういうことなんだ、紬？\n琴葉の台本を盗んだ犯人が、この中にいるって……。", "zh": "䌷，这是什么意思？\n你说偷走琴叶剧本的犯人，就在我们之中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "737d4fcb8a8305d0db9eca85117361599a160e7f02cb6850c42b742aa73f7cef", "ja": "はい。そしてこの名探偵ウォーカーには、\nそれが誰であるかも、わかっています……。", "zh": "没错。而我名侦探沃克，\n也知道是谁偷走的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "832b11518740acc6bc31a78bf99488a439010b43474dc05b23f5a6f439d2c300", "ja": "それは……{$P$}！\n貴方ですっ！！", "zh": "那个人就是……{$P$}！\n你就是犯人！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "9fd0d01ee4e14cdbd335f12e1d63c17277d5764218cdaea6f11c0bf016af3189", "ja": "なんと。{$P$}が\n犯人だったのですか。……衝撃の事実。", "zh": "什么？原来{$P$}就是犯人……\n令人震惊的事实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "dcbaecf832973521f6a7046cad7023360ce2afe9044a214812152546dcaab807", "ja": "いやいや、やってないぞ、そんなこと！", "zh": "不不不，不是我干的，我才没做这种事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "250a1ff72df5cab58ddde2cf16a98206ac83d6ad2468ed7d334c9f53c85b6faa", "ja": "つ、紬ちゃん……どうしてそう言い切れるの？\nなにか、根拠があるのよね？", "zh": "小、小䌷……为什么你这么肯定呢？\n应该有什么证据吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "256016d47c93956dc6395ec1b6247501ecb8df5423af3659232c8a27365ade69", "ja": "無論です。私達が更衣室を後にするとき、\n{$P$}がこの部屋を施錠しました。", "zh": "那是当然。我们离开更衣室时，\n{$P$}留下来锁门。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "196eea8ffc4aa54a922b308be156d54f5bd9895629f0b42757fd0408e5443ee3", "ja": "う、うん……そうだけど。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……是那样没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cc328647e8904034182fbf603d85b162dbf12884780106f92fab37c086940e83", "ja": "すなわち、この部屋から台本を持ち出せるのは\n扉を開けることが可能な人間だけ……。", "zh": "所以，有办法从这房间把剧本拿走的，\n就只有能够开锁的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3ecf2f1e14a353553fece4b98632e44e5da0e185057e336a81a72dd843329e46", "ja": "つまり、カギを持っていた{$P$}！\n貴方が犯人で、間違いありません！", "zh": "也就是说，拿着钥匙的{$P$}！\n你肯定就是犯人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "ac2d7929699c8d2425695bfcf7f0fd4f64de1c3c063c45e9833be1de0ee11e83", "ja": "ま、まさか……理由は、それだけ？", "zh": "该、该不会……根据只有这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8d4e99d9dfaa5b7d0a9838eeb2078a466aba8da2881dc0fa838f9a47a7286563", "ja": "はい。\n……あ、あの。いけなかったでしょうか？", "zh": "是的。\n……请、请问，这样不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "a28122a03bb559bdf3ef46e6df38cf42cdd37623e49bf9c28cd30dd47d79ffa3", "ja": "いけなくはないけど、理由としては弱いんじゃない？\nそれに……。", "zh": "也不是不行，但这根据会不会太薄弱了？\n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "544a8cd40c4a6af9f3c8b2f4a3b667cea34a608e50137576a2818dd546a008d3", "ja": "はっ！　……い、いえ！　もうひとつ、\n{$P$}には立派な動機があります。", "zh": "啊！等、等等！还有一点，\n{$P$}有非常充足的动机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e2c8d417f48317d8804ee629ccd0d2d03f8bd1b41fc18a4f5c499e1c2863a221", "ja": "動機が……あったっけ？", "zh": "动机……我有吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "80545a93329f5c679c58f69949192e636d8e75162f36a2ca07ec3fe0d4183916", "ja": "はい。{$P$}、貴方は、田中さんが\n何か悩んでいるようだと、気にかけていましたね。", "zh": "有的。{$P$}，\n你很担心田中究竟在烦恼什么，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "56e7f54b368faf79dbd58f04e6e53763c2e81eeefd607434921a2970443a5ce7", "ja": "ですが、貴方にはその理由がわからなかった。そこで\n台本をのぞき見し、悩みの原因を探ろうとしたのです！", "zh": "但是，你想不通是什么理由。\n于是，你就想偷看她的剧本，找出造成她烦恼的原因！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "500f1c444a5c8512bf0c6575fcd68c0fe1ed7b957bfcffa33dcd62459754cf45", "ja": "そんな……。", "zh": "怎么会这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e7d48cb87ab5812fffbc628305cdd139c2edc4af8351ea9fb9a96fa7fe595dfa", "ja": "担当アイドルの様子を気にかけるのは、\nプロデューサーとして立派な態度かもしれません。", "zh": "如此关心自己负责的偶像，以一位制作人来说，\n你的态度也许值得嘉奖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d2241ddf832f8d1ca4cf52c821bcc4c8c0ccf66a73bd5c5a55571e5041ffad62", "ja": "悩みを解決してあげたい、その気持ちも理解できます。\nですが、それでも台本を盗むなどというのは……。", "zh": "我能理解你想为偶像解决烦恼的心情。\n但是，也不该因为这样就偷走剧本……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "87ff7123ea8dd7743921e0bae84413dae8891eb4fe2b12018e60461a8f39c102", "ja": "その前に、せめてひとこと相談してくだされば……。", "zh": "要是你在犯案前能先找人商量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "06a22c2c820bc8cc00001909cb0f328f14a10aa86cb62d625759f45bbfbfa9c1", "ja": "ま、待ってくれ！　なんだか同情されてるけど、\n俺は琴葉の台本を持ち出してなんかいないぞ！？", "zh": "等、等一下！你好像开始同情我了，\n但我真的没有拿走琴叶的剧本啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "2cec7f7d485c89d428cdc586dbce5471d111fd8663e59ffd89ab42d773715224", "ja": "っていうか……ねえ、紬さん。お兄ちゃんは、\n桃子たちとずっと一緒にいたじゃない。", "zh": "不是啊……我说，䌷姊，\n大哥哥他一直都和桃子我们在一起啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "ec0be4ff6e6082a21482f1ff0efb122cf8c35576a8064b48301b568e784814cc", "ja": "更衣室に戻って琴葉さんの台本を持ち出す時間なんて\nなかったと思うんだけど？", "zh": "他应该没有时间跑回更衣室\n拿走琴叶姊的剧本吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "5ea19d7373d9f1ed6063c32969128abdcb8ada6a91f1c77b9317aeb68cb40871", "ja": "そうよね。それに、琴葉ちゃんが悩んでいたとして、\nその内容をわざわざ台本に書いたりするかしら？", "zh": "对啊，假设琴叶真的有烦恼好了，\n她也不会直接写在剧本上吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "25250805139d99f8544095fc56a70eeca3d3ea83665c27241c75ed04a5dbfd0e", "ja": "そうですね。それに{$P$}なら、\n直接、私たちに悩みをきいてくれるのではないかと。", "zh": "是啊，况且以{$P$}的为人，\n他应该会直接询问我们有什么烦恼才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "76c971b69cf9fb1f3d7712e9088e8cdda1e14abc8093f28bc4ad41d54158c990", "ja": "そ、そんな。\nでは、いったい誰が犯人だというのですか？", "zh": "怎、怎么会这样？\n那么，犯人究竟是谁呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1033_102mis", "source_sha256": "5fd284c8618dd5ebddeb342a104e3544ec441ba98bda022ca35bbe0a338c417c", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん、琴葉ちゃん……\nあっ、よかった！　ここにいた～！", "zh": "琴叶、琴叶……\n啊，太好了！找到你了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1034_017kth", "source_sha256": "af02e76caac76b986bd38e3d9d4e8a7ae69633650f40fff57031030f5d549017", "ja": "あっ、美咲さん？", "zh": "啊，美咲？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1035_102mis", "source_sha256": "ddc79f7861e3a6ac9dd63ac1e45bdc547ba424b167a4d4e749005d16a9bd1caa", "ja": "はい、これ！　琴葉ちゃんの台本だよね？", "zh": "来，拿去！琴叶，这是你的剧本吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1036_102mis", "source_sha256": "29329685a759ad1f37f9801325c3141e54c585c37a27132a9d707f0ce246bc42", "ja": "さっき片づけに入ったとき、間違って\n雑誌と一緒に持ち出しちゃって……ごめんなさい！", "zh": "刚才我进来收拾的时候，\n不小心把剧本和杂志一起拿走了……对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1037_051tmg", "source_sha256": "acf7ef08ef8ab1862bd5f9bede119a669d7bc047d88ac2b5d083a2d7a3c38634", "ja": "えええっ！？\nけ、けど、更衣室にはカギが……。", "zh": "什么──！？\n可、可是，更衣室有上锁……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "484541a4a7c7bd5f6598685d87afa3baf70c2add151efe17a9e4f91ad234221d", "ja": "更衣室のカギは、事務室にも置いてあるんだ。\n持ってるのが俺ひとりなんて、不便すぎるだろう？", "zh": "事务室里也有放一把更衣室的钥匙。\n不然只有我拿着钥匙，也太不方便了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1040_102mis", "source_sha256": "3e98de18ad9b8d79828b59c33523695436dd2562b8ac6b9c05557ef598ac22ed", "ja": "あの……どうかしたんですか？　紬ちゃん。", "zh": "请问……你怎么了吗？小䌷？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1041_p", "source_sha256": "9d98a7853421f6d4438d93ebea00c822e7fdb1d0f4edacdc5565f541236aa72b", "ja": "いえ、ちょっと……き、気にするな、紬！\nさっきのセリフ回しとか、けっこう探偵っぽかったぞ！", "zh": "没什么，只是有点……䌷，你、你别放在心上！\n刚才讲的那些台词，很有侦探的架式喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1042_051tmg", "source_sha256": "403dc9884433d4db4ac0829ef49c44e8993d0c75f8a73e56cf7ef20b2069272f", "ja": "ほ、ほうっておいてくださいまし！\n……もう～、なんなん～！！", "zh": "请、请不要管我！\n……真是的～搞什么啦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1043_039kon", "source_sha256": "7f8cacdc7b4cb25af85a5a76a78387b77ad0e7def14ad072ab3b79e5cb7553cc", "ja": "あ、あはは……。\nとにかく、これで一件落着ってことよね？", "zh": "哈、哈哈……\n总之，这样事情就告一段落了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1044_017kth", "source_sha256": "b4f0fdf3b48ffac6f27df68874473d91c7dabd637b0d0b3e73fe7792f12d7872", "ja": "あっ……待ってください。元はといえば、\n私が台本を忘れてきてしまったのが悪いんです。", "zh": "啊……请等一下。\n这件事情本来就该怪我不该忘了拿剧本。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1045_017kth", "source_sha256": "399a3b00d2ccf30edf7c6b7edc303e0534d9c9070741ef6c8fa4e67748c34146", "ja": "そのせいで、みんなを混乱させてしまって……。\n本当にごめんなさい。", "zh": "因为我的关系，害大家陷入混乱……\n真的很抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1046_p", "source_sha256": "74f016f3ab8ce4e56c5fb6307fc7dd590693df777ca5514989cbfbc9dfba09dd", "ja": "そんな事はないけど……でも琴葉、\n本当に何かあるなら、話してみてくれないか？", "zh": "没有那种事啦……不过，琴叶，\n要是你真的有心事，要不要试着说出来呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1047_p", "source_sha256": "9bbacf5bbdec459ad185d6a92afcbc4fd863202319a8d6015924e39b975965d3", "ja": "悩んでいる事があるなら、相談に乗るから……。", "zh": "如果有烦恼，可以跟我商量的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1048_017kth", "source_sha256": "4d7b5069dc2b8a15394c9db9119751bc749b85d24f20618f0667fa46af937bae", "ja": "いえ、それは……。", "zh": "不，这……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1049_049mom", "source_sha256": "9c90082bc90aef1ca0cc0cfef0f930bdeed3bb338c96da779f3d239e03b8d24e", "ja": "もう……鈍いなぁ、お兄ちゃんは。琴葉さんも、\nこの際だから、はっきり言ったほうがいいと思うよ？", "zh": "真是的……你很迟钝耶，大哥哥。琴叶姊，你也是。\n事到如今，你还是直接讲清楚吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1050_049mom", "source_sha256": "26031de74ddc9088554024ae2b8c29c3a3fbbda204695658453664e63b587b4c", "ja": "そうでないと、この先の稽古が進まないと思う。\n琴葉さんも桃子も、もちろん、みんなもね。", "zh": "不然，接下来可能也排不了戏了。\n不管是琴叶姊还是桃子，当然，大家也都一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1051_017kth", "source_sha256": "32301b741f0b13d278e63ee06756d9c3869094b4c7a6aa69758cda4728967e55", "ja": "桃子ちゃん……。\nうん……そうだよね……。", "zh": "桃子……\n嗯……你说得对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1052_017kth", "source_sha256": "2df0e7dc5f4ec5250acaabb2fe123d56107fd07ad882d97ff6a5a43e50f95f57", "ja": "……{$P$}。\n私を、みんなとの稽古から外してほしいんです。", "zh": "……{$P$}。\n我希望你别让我和大家一起排演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1053_p", "source_sha256": "922506c3c164a3fde9d5efc9fc89c2448f32e82136679877ab6a9d45feccca1c", "ja": "えっ！？\n琴葉、それは一体どういう……。", "zh": "什么！？\n琴叶，这究竟是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1054_017kth", "source_sha256": "7df492c1417ef78a35574291ad16c243b42658d3881b33f2aa0c73e22b897e6a", "ja": "今回私がいただいた役は、劇場の新人女優です。\nまだ仲間には、心を開いていない……。", "zh": "我这次拿到的角色，是剧场的新人演员。\n她尚未对其他团员敞开心胸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1055_017kth", "source_sha256": "9fb4d66e64719bf561b1f8192fa88e748e87d35b436ccadaa2b57708c0d85ded", "ja": "だから……いつものようにみんなと一緒だと、\nどうしても役の気持ちになりきれないことがあって。", "zh": "所以……如果我像平常一样跟大家一起练习，\n就会很难真正融入这个角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1056_017kth", "source_sha256": "6f5d46f3def44c6d1dbe083d090472d5ddb39f4c4d50f7431d4a5279c2fee521", "ja": "ごめんなさい。私のワガママだってこと、\nわかってはいるんです。けど、今は……。", "zh": "对不起，我知道这是很任性的要求。\n可是，现在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1057_p", "source_sha256": "aa42e84d80fae3c7b1cdab99e8bcb7b59d3e615ef06c9b0140eccdae25493a1d", "ja": "いや、ワガママだなんて、そんな事はないよ。\nそうか、そういう理由だったのか……。", "zh": "不，这样一点也不任性。\n原来如此，是这样的理由……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1058_017kth", "source_sha256": "7462a3510cab28b8185f1b4bdb71254c1c21b3d7ce260c2d0436139d66ea291a", "ja": "はい……すみません……。", "zh": "是的……不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1059_p", "source_sha256": "83cc0308dd409ed16926a57dde3e80896cebbe07fed60aac16fa8126275f4e69", "ja": "それじゃ、撮影開始まで……全体練習への参加は、\n任意とする。もちろん、全員だ。", "zh": "那么，在开拍之前……全体练习采取自由参加。\n当然，所有人一视同仁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1060_049mom", "source_sha256": "39b265e329578d6c9acfed7e7f44a439f5b77463ff057ff9bc2b448ca234b5c5", "ja": "それがいいと思うよ。\n桃子も、ひとりの練習時間、欲しかったしね。", "zh": "桃子也觉得这样很好。\n因为桃子自己也想要一个人练习的时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1061_039kon", "source_sha256": "4ee90b777f9f273c7dff5584b0dec0859d91b1cc3b178d74b837efdf1faa4369", "ja": "そうよね……たしかに、ひとりの練習時間も必要だわ。\n何しろこのお話、大変なことになっちゃうんですもの。", "zh": "是啊……单独练习的时间确实是必要的。\n毕竟这个剧情，接下来会有重大转折嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1062_102mis", "source_sha256": "ad821cfbfda83d90c1ff4795d00c82d500cddb2b2ec207d9a3f817980c12eb73", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1063_p", "source_sha256": "683f5aa45f050dadf2f3100b8176d9c097c858fabc54bf39875490f56a8fa665", "ja": "あれ？　青羽さん、台本読んでないんですか？\n実はですね……。", "zh": "咦？青羽小姐，你没看剧本吗？\n其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1064_049mom", "source_sha256": "43363275339c046add68a520ffd8570e912d1808952ec726bc30f12c873a9679", "ja": "ネタバレ禁止っ！", "zh": "禁止剧透！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1065_039kon", "source_sha256": "396561dce18f7ff7bb1984a117b1fdcf00f6b5f70983c5b9c2431d716718ddad", "ja": "ネタバレ禁止よ！", "zh": "禁止剧透喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1066_044miz", "source_sha256": "633d08a687fc038e7810ecdd21c738f2d2b09f6f70a0b9411f223d0f16b91c33", "ja": "ネタバレ禁止です。", "zh": "禁止剧透。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1067_p", "source_sha256": "7e9dcb29e9c43c3223e559a9c8cd6ac7e6faeb7a9763352ba3eae8d13f053215", "ja": "わっ！？　す、すまない……そうだった、\n危うく社長の二の舞になるところだった……。", "zh": "哇！？抱、抱歉……我都忘了，\n差点就重蹈社长的覆辙了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1068_017kth", "source_sha256": "e787a24df7e7e99a9c855fddddb3ea114fb1a6c182a3e1cb7329388853fdb330", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとうございます。\n紬ちゃん……みんなも、本当にありがとう。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你。\n小䌷……还有大家也是，真的很谢谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1069_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b21fcbcb00a4bd60a8548db526fd158c854d91d5a6eca91710b4350c6f03ba0e", "ja": "い、いえ。私は、何も……。", "zh": "不、不会，我什么都没做……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1070_017kth", "source_sha256": "bb2ea6b4498ec782529f01cae334f0c0a558152c925d0ef568cc25663a6cf4ab", "ja": "私、この作品を最高の映画にするために\n一生懸命がんばります！　見ていてくださいね♪", "zh": "我会拚命努力，\n让这部作品成为最棒的电影！请大家拭目以待吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_05_1071_p", "source_sha256": "108ba5f2e73dc7ba4dd62fb33e3d75b5338593baf8b4cc3f1f717ab779670a93", "ja": "（ハプニングもあったが、最後は上手くまとまった。\nこれでみんな、稽古に集中できるだろう……！）", "zh": "（虽然发生了点小插曲，但最后还是顺利解决问题了。\n这样大家应该都能专注在排演上了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
